'''KOI''' (also known as '''Movistar KOI''' for sponsorship purposes) is a [[:Category:Spain|Spanish]] esports organization founded by [[leagueoflegends:Ibai|Ibai]] and [[wikipedia:Gerard_Piqué|Gerard Piqué]] in December 2021. The organization entered VALORANT in January 2022, joining the Spanish Regional League. <ref name="KOI 2022/>

In January 2024 [[wikipedia:OverActive_Media|OverActive Media]] announced the acquisition of  '''[[KOI]]''' and '''[[Movistar Riders]]''', merging it with '''[[MAD Lions]]''' to form a single organization.

On September 6<sup>th</sup>, 2025, [[Riot Games]] announced that '''KOI'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s partnership agreement in the VCT EMEA International League has been terminated, citing a breach of the team's contractual agreement. <ref>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/valesports_emea/status/1964325341998075991|title=VCT EMEA Update|date=2025-09-06|author=[[Riot Games]]}}</ref>

